{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e12-scene-08",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "有人给我们埋了一个陷阱  (Someone Planted a Trap for Us)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "stella": "斯戴拉",
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "When a music publisher files a formal lawsuit accusing Xingtian and Xin Huimei of willful copyright infringement on the duet song, PR director Stella storms into Unit One—and Kaiwen checks the original paper contract from legal. Listen to Stella, Kaiwen, and Bu Xiaogu in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "到底怎么侵的权，你们怎么还没查出来啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "什么授权？法院的传票没看见吗！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "授权附表和咱们系统里的记录对不上！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "就差这一首，对方没有授权给咱们。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "别查了，翻来覆去查了好几遍了，没有。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "这么说，咱们侵权是事实了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这一切都太巧了，所有事都太巧了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你还看不出来吗？这就是个套！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这是什么套啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "有人给我们埋了一个陷阱，而且已经埋很久了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "合同是去年十月签的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "去年十月？那时候我刚刚来星天实习，是王尔老师带我实习的！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "到底怎么侵的权，你们怎么还没查出来啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How on earth did we infringe copyright — why haven't you tracked down the cause yet?!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "什么授权？法院的传票没看见吗！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What authorization? Haven't you seen the court summons sitting right here?!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "授权附表和咱们系统里的记录对不上！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The signed licensing appendix doesn't match the record in our internal database!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "就差这一首，对方没有授权给咱们。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That one single song is missing — they never licensed it to us.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "别查了，翻来覆去查了好几遍了，没有。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stop searching; I checked the pages front to back over and over, and it isn't there.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "这么说，咱们侵权是事实了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So our copyright infringement is an undeniable fact?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这一切都太巧了，所有事都太巧了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All of this is far too coincidental — every single piece lines up too neatly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你还看不出来吗？这就是个套！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Can't you see it yet? This whole thing is a setup!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这是什么套啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What kind of setup?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "有人给我们埋了一个陷阱，而且已经埋很久了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Someone planted a trap for us inside our own system — and buried it a long time ago.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "合同是去年十月签的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This licensing contract was signed last October.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "去年十月？那时候我刚刚来星天实习，是王尔老师带我实习的！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Last October? That was right when I started interning at Xingtian under Wang Er!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "到底怎么侵的权，你们怎么还没查出来啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "什么授权？法院的传票没看见吗！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "授权附表和咱们系统里的记录对不上！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "就差这一首，对方没有授权给咱们。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "别查了，翻来覆去查了好几遍了，没有。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "这么说，咱们侵权是事实了？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这一切都太巧了，所有事都太巧了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你还看不出来吗？这就是个套！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这是什么套啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "有人给我们埋了一个陷阱，而且已经埋很久了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "合同是去年十月签的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "去年十月？那时候我刚刚来星天实习，是王尔老师带我实习的！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Realizing that the database showed three-year rights while the signed contract appendix omitted that single song, Kaiwen spots a deliberate trap planted last autumn when Wang Er supervised Xiaogu. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
